  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[CLOSED] Frontier Technologies 2 CORE: exploring the use of frontier technology with FCDO staff and partners to test and scale innovations with the potential for positive impact on global challenges</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity [CLOSED] Frontier Technologies 2 CORE: exploring the use of frontier technology with FCDO staff and partners to test and scale innovations with the potential for positive impact on global challenges is a component of I2I - Ideas to Impact - Testing new technologies and innovative approaches to address development challenges. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;3,349,398. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Technological research and development, Environmental policy and administrative management, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
